        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0213",
        "start_sec": 716.84,
        "end_sec": 720.38,
        "text": "好那文字辨識出來之後我要做執行邏輯"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0214",
        "start_sec": 720.38,
        "end_sec": 722.02,
        "text": "什麼叫執行邏輯就是"
