        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0256",
        "start_sec": 841.51,
        "end_sec": 844.77,
        "text": "哦那這就是不同的執行邏輯啦"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0257",
        "start_sec": 845.11,
        "end_sec": 848.67,
        "text": "所以通常跟ai比較明確"
