        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0260",
        "start_sec": 853.07,
        "end_sec": 855.57,
        "text": "哦畫藍色的這個部分啊"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0261",
        "start_sec": 855.77,
        "end_sec": 859.13,
        "text": "那前面的話黃色的部分是資料的前處理"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0262",
        "start_sec": 859.27,
        "end_sec": 860.63,
        "text": "那我們其實"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0263",
        "start_sec": 861.03,
        "end_sec": 862.83,
        "text": "呃我們其實是知道啊"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0264",
        "start_sec": 863.17,
        "end_sec": 865.83,
        "text": "一個ai的模型你沒有良好的資料"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0265",
        "start_sec": 866.23,
        "end_sec": 868.93,
        "text": "那個資料品質如果不過關的話呢"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0266",
        "start_sec": 869.07,
        "end_sec": 871.57,
        "text": "哦那下層也是garage in garbage out"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0267",
        "start_sec": 871.57,
        "end_sec": 875.03,
        "text": "啊所以呃這個部分也是很重要的"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0268",
        "start_sec": 875.33,
        "end_sec": 876.33,
        "text": "那我們"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0269",
        "start_sec": 876.83,
        "end_sec": 879.99,
        "text": "呃目前市面上其實講到"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0270",
        "start_sec": 879.99,
        "end_sec": 882.29,
        "text": "影像處理跟ai有關的話"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0271",
        "start_sec": 882.39,
        "end_sec": 884.59,
        "text": "呃大家可能會有幾個套件"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0272",
        "start_sec": 884.79,
        "end_sec": 887.15,
        "text": "常常聽到他們的名字"
      },
