        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0273",
        "start_sec": 887.29,
        "end_sec": 889.11,
        "text": "第一個就是open cv"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0274",
        "start_sec": 889.21,
        "end_sec": 891.25,
        "text": "好那open cv大概算是"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0275",
        "start_sec": 891.51,
        "end_sec": 894.95,
        "text": "呃不管你用你後續搭配什麼套件"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0276",
        "start_sec": 894.95,
        "end_sec": 897.41,
        "text": "搭配yolo也好搭配zuckin learn也好"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0277",
        "start_sec": 897.61,
        "end_sec": 899.85,
        "text": "搭配其他的dlive也好"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0278",
        "start_sec": 900.11,
        "end_sec": 903.79,
        "text": "大十四八九都會前面都是open cv啦"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0279",
        "start_sec": 904.11,
        "end_sec": 904.61,
        "text": "好"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0280",
        "start_sec": 905.69,
        "end_sec": 906.11,
        "text": "那"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0281",
        "start_sec": 907.15,
        "end_sec": 909.95,
        "text": "這個open cv裡面呢他其實內建"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0282",
        "start_sec": 910.15,
        "end_sec": 911.75,
        "text": "他內建也有一些"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0283",
        "start_sec": 912.05,
        "end_sec": 912.99,
        "text": "基本的"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0284",
        "start_sec": 912.99,
        "end_sec": 915.81,
        "text": "哦基本的影像偵測的模型"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0285",
        "start_sec": 916.09,
        "end_sec": 918.01,
        "text": "比方說像人臉偵測"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0286",
        "start_sec": 918.31,
        "end_sec": 920.81,
        "text": "哦比方說像一些那個"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0287",
        "start_sec": 921.01,
        "end_sec": 922.31,
        "text": "呃比較"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0288",
        "start_sec": 922.81,
        "end_sec": 926.01,
        "text": "經典的一些東西他裡面是有的啦"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0289",
        "start_sec": 926.59,
        "end_sec": 927.61,
        "text": "那所以說"
