      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0291",
        "start_sec": 931.51,
        "end_sec": 932.99,
        "text": "藍色的部分"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0292",
        "start_sec": 933.21,
        "end_sec": 936.01,
        "text": "但是有一些比較困難的地方可能要用"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0293",
        "start_sec": 936.01,
        "end_sec": 938.21,
        "text": "其他的套件啊像yolo啊"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0294",
        "start_sec": 938.21,
        "end_sec": 939.81,
        "text": "或者是dlive來做"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0295",
        "start_sec": 940.09,
        "end_sec": 942.51,
        "text": "呃舉例來講如果我想要知道"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0296",
        "start_sec": 942.51,
        "end_sec": 944.13,
        "text": "一個人的表情怎麼樣"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0297",
        "start_sec": 944.13,
        "end_sec": 946.51,
        "text": "哦那這個在我們後面的"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0298",
        "start_sec": 946.87,
        "end_sec": 949.23,
        "text": "專案的時候呢會有一個"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0299",
        "start_sec": 949.41,
        "end_sec": 952.43,
        "text": "我們有設計一個專案叫做專注度檢測"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0300",
        "start_sec": 952.43,
        "end_sec": 954.13,
        "text": "哦去檢測那個"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0301",
        "start_sec": 954.33,
        "end_sec": 957.31,
        "text": "攝影機裡面拍到的人有沒有在打瞌睡啦"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0302",
        "start_sec": 957.53,
        "end_sec": 960.61,
        "text": "那這個東西呢他就是屬於那個"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0303",
        "start_sec": 960.61,
        "end_sec": 962.33,
        "text": "呃dlive"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0304",
        "start_sec": 962.33,
        "end_sec": 965.33,
        "text": "哦可以搭配使用的一個"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0305",
        "start_sec": 965.67,
        "end_sec": 967.41,
        "text": "呃一個套件哦"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0306",
        "start_sec": 967.57,
        "end_sec": 969.93,
        "text": "那另外呢像像呃"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0307",
        "start_sec": 969.93,
        "end_sec": 972.39,
        "text": "如果你要偵測各式各樣不同的東西"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0308",
        "start_sec": 972.39,
        "end_sec": 974.05,
        "text": "像是入口"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0309",
        "start_sec": 974.45,
        "end_sec": 977.65,
        "text": "是否呃是否有車子開過去"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0310",
        "start_sec": 977.85,
        "end_sec": 981.23,
        "text": "或者是畫面裡面有多少個人啊"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0311",
        "start_sec": 981.23,
        "end_sec": 982.95,
        "text": "之類的這種應用的話呢"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0312",
        "start_sec": 983.13,
        "end_sec": 985.25,
        "text": "那有一個套件也是非常"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0313",
        "start_sec": 986.75,
        "end_sec": 989.43,
        "text": "呃非常有名的啊他叫yolo"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0314",
        "start_sec": 990.79,
        "end_sec": 992.35,
        "text": "這個我們也會"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0315",
        "start_sec": 992.59,
        "end_sec": 995.83,
        "text": "呃帶大家稍微看一下哦"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0316",
        "start_sec": 996.09,
        "end_sec": 996.75,
        "text": "那"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0317",
        "start_sec": 997.33,
        "end_sec": 999.09,
        "text": "我們剛剛講了有兩個步驟"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0318",
        "start_sec": 999.09,
        "end_sec": 1001.55,
        "text": "一個叫物件偵測一個叫物件分類"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0319",
        "start_sec": 1001.55,
        "end_sec": 1004.31,
        "text": "啦哦那物件偵測類的"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0320",
        "start_sec": 1004.81,
        "end_sec": 1008.91,
        "text": "那個模型我們通常比較難自己去訓練"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0321",
        "start_sec": 1009.51,
        "end_sec": 1012.61,
        "text": "哦物件偵測類的模型我們比較難自己去訓練"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0322",
        "start_sec": 1012.61,
        "end_sec": 1015.81,
        "text": "因為他偵測類的模型訓練成本比較高"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0323",
        "start_sec": 1016.11,
        "end_sec": 1017.91,
        "text": "哦你要知道畫面裡面"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0324",
        "start_sec": 1018.21,
        "end_sec": 1020.85,
        "text": "哦你要知道畫面裡面有各式各樣的物品"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0325",
        "start_sec": 1020.85,
        "end_sec": 1022.55,
        "text": "而且他的位置要在哪裡"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0326",
        "start_sec": 1022.55,
        "end_sec": 1024.99,
        "text": "這訓練起來是成本比較高的"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0327",
        "start_sec": 1025.31,
        "end_sec": 1025.91,
        "text": "那"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0328",
        "start_sec": 1026.25,
        "end_sec": 1028.91,
        "text": "但是物件分類會比較簡單啦哦"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0329",
        "start_sec": 1029.09,
        "end_sec": 1032.31,
        "text": "所以我們後面的專案裡面有安排"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0330",
        "start_sec": 1032.51,
        "end_sec": 1036.11,
        "text": "那個像是呃半導體的瑕疵檢測"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0331",
        "start_sec": 1036.31,
        "end_sec": 1037.41,
        "text": "以及那個"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0332",
        "start_sec": 1038.11,
        "end_sec": 1040.05,
        "text": "呃廢布的ct"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0333",
        "start_sec": 1040.21,
        "end_sec": 1042.61,
        "text": "哦電腦斷層掃描我們來判"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0334",
        "start_sec": 1042.91,
        "end_sec": 1046.31,
        "text": "判斷他可能會是屬於哪一種疾病"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0335",
        "start_sec": 1046.55,
        "end_sec": 1049.51,
        "text": "好那都是屬於物件分類的問題"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0336",
        "start_sec": 1049.71,
        "end_sec": 1050.91,
        "text": "那物件偵測呢"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0337",
        "start_sec": 1050.91,
        "end_sec": 1053.65,
        "text": "我們會帶大家簡單的看一下yolo"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0338",
        "start_sec": 1056.11,
        "end_sec": 1058.55,
        "text": "好那這邊我們看到一次看到了"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0339",
        "start_sec": 1058.55,
        "end_sec": 1061.61,
        "text": "這麼多個名詞相信大家也覺得很奇怪了"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0340",
        "start_sec": 1061.61,
        "end_sec": 1064.85,
        "text": "那這些名詞他到底有什麼不一樣"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0341",
        "start_sec": 1065.05,
        "end_sec": 1066.15,
        "text": "這麼多套件"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0342",
        "start_sec": 1066.15,
        "end_sec": 1066.61,
        "text": "哦"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0343",
        "start_sec": 1066.85,
        "end_sec": 1070.31,
        "text": "好你看同樣opencv他內建的套件可以做"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0344",
        "start_sec": 1070.55,
        "end_sec": 1073.31,
        "text": "分類可以做偵測yolo也可以"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0345",
        "start_sec": 1073.31,
        "end_sec": 1075.61,
        "text": "dlib也可以那這些套件"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0346",
        "start_sec": 1075.85,
        "end_sec": 1079.45,
        "text": "呃到用這些套件去做到底有什麼不一樣"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0347",
        "start_sec": 1079.45,
        "end_sec": 1081.21,
        "text": "好那這邊我們呃"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0348",
        "start_sec": 1081.21,
        "end_sec": 1083.65,
        "text": "幫大家簡單的整理了一下"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0349",
        "start_sec": 1084.21,
        "end_sec": 1087.55,
        "text": "那首先第一個opencv跟yolo"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0350",
        "start_sec": 1087.85,
        "end_sec": 1092.21,
        "text": "好那這這兩個都是很常被拿來做使用的套件"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0351",
        "start_sec": 1092.81,
        "end_sec": 1095.81,
        "text": "那opencv他本身也有內建"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0352",
        "start_sec": 1095.81,
        "end_sec": 1097.11,
        "text": "哦一些那個"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0353",
        "start_sec": 1097.55,
        "end_sec": 1100.01,
        "text": "呃分類跟偵測的功能"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0354",
        "start_sec": 1100.21,
        "end_sec": 1101.85,
        "text": "那他跟yolo比"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0355",
        "start_sec": 1102.01,
        "end_sec": 1102.81,
        "text": "哦主要"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0356",
        "start_sec": 1103.31,
        "end_sec": 1105.95,
        "text": "就是他有一些細節上會有差異的哦"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0357",
        "start_sec": 1105.95,
        "end_sec": 1106.61,
        "text": "第一個"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0358",
        "start_sec": 1107.55,
        "end_sec": 1112.11,
        "text": "opencv他是可以使用cpu來運算的"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0359",
        "start_sec": 1112.51,
        "end_sec": 1115.81,
        "text": "哦opencv他是可以使用cpu運算"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0360",
        "start_sec": 1116.11,
        "end_sec": 1117.97,
        "text": "那yolo這個東西不太一樣"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0361",
        "start_sec": 1117.97,
        "end_sec": 1119.21,
        "text": "他是可以用gpu"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0362",
        "start_sec": 1119.21,
        "end_sec": 1121.01,
        "text": "他是必須要用gpu的"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0363",
        "start_sec": 1121.21,
        "end_sec": 1122.11,
        "text": "當然啊哦"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0364",
        "start_sec": 1122.31,
        "end_sec": 1124.61,
        "text": "呃其實你到網路上面去找也可以"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0365",
        "start_sec": 1124.61,
        "end_sec": 1127.01,
        "text": "呃是可以找到有些人呃"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0366",
        "start_sec": 1127.67,
        "end_sec": 1128.87,
        "text": "呃有去"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0367",
        "start_sec": 1129.57,
        "end_sec": 1133.31,
        "text": "呃搭配一個版本就是用cpu用的yolo"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0368",
        "start_sec": 1133.31,
        "end_sec": 1135.27,
        "text": "不過那個效果非常非常的差啦"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0369",
        "start_sec": 1135.27,
        "end_sec": 1136.87,
        "text": "哦速度很慢"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0370",
        "start_sec": 1137.11,
        "end_sec": 1139.27,
        "text": "哦主要是速度實在太慢了慢到"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0371",
        "start_sec": 1139.57,
        "end_sec": 1143.07,
        "text": "實用狀態下不太能接受"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0372",
        "start_sec": 1143.23,
        "end_sec": 1145.97,
        "text": "哦所以你就當沒有那個東西就好了"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0373",
        "start_sec": 1146.43,
        "end_sec": 1148.73,
        "text": "那所以通常在沒有"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0374",
        "start_sec": 1148.73,
        "end_sec": 1150.93,
        "text": "如果你的設備沒有gpu的時候"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0375",
        "start_sec": 1151.13,
        "end_sec": 1152.87,
        "text": "我們通常會利用像"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0376",
        "start_sec": 1152.97,
        "end_sec": 1154.83,
        "text": "那個opencv之類的"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0377",
        "start_sec": 1155.03,
        "end_sec": 1156.97,
        "text": "或者是呃一些"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0378",
        "start_sec": 1157.27,
        "end_sec": 1159.87,
        "text": "那個呃小型的模式呃"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0379",
        "start_sec": 1159.87,
        "end_sec": 1161.73,
        "text": "比較小型的模型去做啊"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0380",
        "start_sec": 1161.93,
        "end_sec": 1164.63,
        "text": "哦不會用到像yolo這種"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0381",
        "start_sec": 1164.73,
        "end_sec": 1166.83,
        "text": "比較那個能力比較強"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0382",
        "start_sec": 1166.83,
        "end_sec": 1168.97,
        "text": "但是比較耗運算支援的東西"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0383",
        "start_sec": 1169.73,
        "end_sec": 1171.03,
        "text": "好那第二個就是說"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0384",
        "start_sec": 1171.35,
        "end_sec": 1173.05,
        "text": "他的底層啊"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0385",
        "start_sec": 1173.05,
        "end_sec": 1175.53,
        "text": "他的底層的那個呃"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0386",
        "start_sec": 1175.53,
        "end_sec": 1178.55,
        "text": "程式語言邏輯有點不一樣啊"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0387",
        "start_sec": 1178.75,
        "end_sec": 1180.89,
        "text": "也就是yolo的那個呃"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0388",
        "start_sec": 1180.89,
        "end_sec": 1184.49,
        "text": "他的底層運作的韓式是用c語言寫的"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0389",
        "start_sec": 1184.89,
        "end_sec": 1186.65,
        "text": "那其實c語言他的"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0390",
        "start_sec": 1187.05,
        "end_sec": 1189.35,
        "text": "他的那個執行效率很好吧"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0391",
        "start_sec": 1189.59,
        "end_sec": 1192.35,
        "text": "但是大家也知道c語言跟python"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0392",
        "start_sec": 1192.35,
        "end_sec": 1194.45,
        "text": "畢竟是不同語言啊"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0393",
        "start_sec": 1194.45,
        "end_sec": 1197.45,
        "text": "那使用起來稍微比較沒有那麼方便啊"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0394",
        "start_sec": 1197.63,
        "end_sec": 1200.65,
        "text": "那當然你說現在新版的yolo"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0395",
        "start_sec": 1200.95,
        "end_sec": 1203.37,
        "text": "像現在的呃yolo v10"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0396",
        "start_sec": 1203.37,
        "end_sec": 1205.47,
        "text": "他其實有python的版本"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0397",
        "start_sec": 1205.71,
        "end_sec": 1207.21,
        "text": "哦他是有python版本的"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0398",
        "start_sec": 1207.21,
        "end_sec": 1209.61,
        "text": "但是啊那個python的版本他的"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0399",
        "start_sec": 1209.97,
        "end_sec": 1212.01,
        "text": "他的那個呃硬體"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0400",
        "start_sec": 1212.17,
        "end_sec": 1214.31,
        "text": "硬體的消耗支援誘比"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0401",
        "start_sec": 1214.57,
        "end_sec": 1217.45,
        "text": "呃誘比之前c語言的版本要大了"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0402",
        "start_sec": 1217.45,
        "end_sec": 1220.11,
        "text": "所以呃這個有點兩難啊"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0403",
        "start_sec": 1220.11,
        "end_sec": 1221.91,
        "text": "我們後面其實會帶大家"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0404",
        "start_sec": 1222.15,
        "end_sec": 1224.57,
        "text": "看說啊這幾個版本差在哪裡"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0405",
        "start_sec": 1226.66,
        "end_sec": 1227.66,
        "text": "好那"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0406",
        "start_sec": 1228.26,
        "end_sec": 1229.72,
        "text": "除此之外呢哦"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0407",
        "start_sec": 1229.72,
        "end_sec": 1232.54,
        "text": "我們上面這個地方單純是講的"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0408",
        "start_sec": 1232.54,
        "end_sec": 1234.62,
        "text": "呃就是分類器"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0409",
        "start_sec": 1235.18,
        "end_sec": 1237.28,
        "text": "呃分類器的比較"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0410",
        "start_sec": 1239.63,
        "end_sec": 1240.13,
        "text": "呃"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0411",
        "start_sec": 1240.83,
        "end_sec": 1242.97,
        "text": "這個單純比分類器"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0412",
        "start_sec": 1243.19,
        "end_sec": 1245.13,
        "text": "那如果要比其他功能的話"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0413",
        "start_sec": 1245.13,
        "end_sec": 1246.83,
        "text": "那outncp就多了"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0414",
        "start_sec": 1246.83,
        "end_sec": 1249.27,
        "text": "呃他自帶繪圖的能力"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0415",
        "start_sec": 1249.43,
        "end_sec": 1252.99,
        "text": "我們呃今天會帶大家介紹"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0416",
        "start_sec": 1253.23,
        "end_sec": 1256.07,
        "text": "另外一個是他可以去接攝影機信號"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0417",
        "start_sec": 1256.19,
        "end_sec": 1258.49,
        "text": "哦這個如果你要自己處理"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0418",
        "start_sec": 1258.49,
        "end_sec": 1260.63,
        "text": "處理起來的話其實挺麻煩的"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0419",
        "start_sec": 1260.75,
        "end_sec": 1263.75,
        "text": "你可能會需要呃去調用"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0420",
        "start_sec": 1263.85,
        "end_sec": 1264.99,
        "text": "那個硬體設備"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0421",
        "start_sec": 1264.99,
        "end_sec": 1267.05,
        "text": "通常需要調用硬體設備的"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0422",
        "start_sec": 1267.59,
        "end_sec": 1269.85,
        "text": "呃處理起來都是比較累的"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0423",
        "start_sec": 1271.49,
        "end_sec": 1273.19,
        "text": "所以這是outncp的好處"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0424",
        "start_sec": 1273.19,
        "end_sec": 1274.13,
        "text": "那優勞呢"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0425",
        "start_sec": 1274.13,
        "end_sec": 1275.69,
        "text": "好優勞的好處是"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0426",
        "start_sec": 1275.69,
        "end_sec": 1277.45,
        "text": "如果你有gpu的話"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0427",
        "start_sec": 1277.55,
        "end_sec": 1279.25,
        "text": "哦當然這前提是你要"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0428",
        "start_sec": 1280.25,
        "end_sec": 1281.19,
        "text": "你看又來"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0429",
        "start_sec": 1281.53,
        "end_sec": 1283.15,
        "text": "等一下哦到底是怎麼回事"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0430",
        "start_sec": 1283.93,
        "end_sec": 1285.35,
        "text": "呃又跳掉"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0431",
        "start_sec": 1285.65,
        "end_sec": 1298.16,
        "text": "看一下"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0432",
        "start_sec": 1300.34,
        "end_sec": 1301.64,
        "text": "不然這樣好了"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0433",
        "start_sec": 1316.22,
        "end_sec": 1317.72,
        "text": "這樣這樣不能寫"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0434",
        "start_sec": 1328.84,
        "end_sec": 1329.56,
        "text": "好算了"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0435",
        "start_sec": 1340.97,
        "end_sec": 1344.27,
        "text": "好那另外一個差別就是在優勞"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0436",
        "start_sec": 1344.27,
        "end_sec": 1345.87,
        "text": "哦他有呃"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0437",
        "start_sec": 1345.87,
        "end_sec": 1347.75,
        "text": "如果你有gpu的情況下"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0438",
        "start_sec": 1347.75,
        "end_sec": 1348.97,
        "text": "他的速度很快"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0439",
        "start_sec": 1349.37,
        "end_sec": 1352.85,
        "text": "那優勞的全名叫做you only look one"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0440",
        "start_sec": 1353.01,
        "end_sec": 1355.61,
        "text": "意思就是你只要看一次就好了啦"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0441",
        "start_sec": 1355.81,
        "end_sec": 1357.35,
        "text": "好那他的好處就是說"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0442",
        "start_sec": 1357.35,
        "end_sec": 1358.61,
        "text": "假設你一個"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0443",
        "start_sec": 1358.85,
        "end_sec": 1359.97,
        "text": "一個照片裡面"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0444",
        "start_sec": 1359.97,
        "end_sec": 1362.71,
        "text": "他有很多很多種不同的東西"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0445",
        "start_sec": 1363.85,
        "end_sec": 1365.35,
        "text": "好我這邊取例哦"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0446",
        "start_sec": 1367.16,
        "end_sec": 1368.52,
        "text": "假設這邊是狗"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0447",
        "start_sec": 1370.28,
        "end_sec": 1371.78,
        "text": "好然後"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0448",
        "start_sec": 1374.7,
        "end_sec": 1375.7,
        "text": "這邊有貓"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0449",
        "start_sec": 1378.55,
        "end_sec": 1379.55,
        "text": "然後呢"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0450",
        "start_sec": 1382.82,
        "end_sec": 1384.52,
        "text": "好這邊有一輛車"
