        "text": "那麼"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0453",
        "start_sec": 1392.48,
        "end_sec": 1394.66,
        "text": "哎呦我這邊冊子畫兩個好了"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0454",
        "start_sec": 1396.76,
        "end_sec": 1399.18,
        "text": "那一般呢我們的做法"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0455",
        "start_sec": 1399.42,
        "end_sec": 1400.62,
        "text": "是怎麼做呢"
