        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0502",
        "start_sec": 1528.12,
        "end_sec": 1529.12,
        "text": "一個一個做"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0503",
        "start_sec": 1533.18,
        "end_sec": 1535.94,
        "text": "啊有時候你還得一個一個做這很麻煩啊"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0504",
        "start_sec": 1537.04,
        "end_sec": 1537.54,
        "text": "啊"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0505",
        "start_sec": 1537.9,
        "end_sec": 1538.3,
        "text": "那"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0506",
        "start_sec": 1539.18,
        "end_sec": 1540.58,
        "text": "但是優勞不一樣"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0507",
        "start_sec": 1543.32,
        "end_sec": 1543.72,
        "text": "啊"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0508",
        "start_sec": 1544.16,
        "end_sec": 1546.96,
        "text": "這是傳統的傳統的狀況"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0509",
        "start_sec": 1549.08,
        "end_sec": 1552.32,
        "text": "啊這個就這個就是我講的好傳統"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0510",
        "start_sec": 1558.51,
        "end_sec": 1560.31,
        "text": "那優勞不不搞這一套"
      },
