        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0528",
        "start_sec": 1638.93,
        "end_sec": 1640.53,
        "text": "啊他一次就找出來了"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0529",
        "start_sec": 1643.24,
        "end_sec": 1644.44,
        "text": "那大家你看哦"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0530",
        "start_sec": 1644.84,
        "end_sec": 1647.78,
        "text": "處理三次跟處理一次拿個比較快"
