        "start_sec": 1726.25,
        "end_sec": 1728.07,
        "text": "啊那個場景路啊"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0567",
        "start_sec": 1728.31,
        "end_sec": 1730.21,
        "text": "啊貓啊狗啊"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0568",
        "start_sec": 1730.41,
        "end_sec": 1732.15,
        "text": "啊這些他都認得出來"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0569",
        "start_sec": 1733.71,
        "end_sec": 1735.31,
        "text": "如果你是要"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0570",
        "start_sec": 1735.91,
        "end_sec": 1738.61,
        "text": "認我剛剛講的那這幾種"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0571",
        "start_sec": 1738.77,
        "end_sec": 1741.71,
        "text": "啊這幾種比較經典的東西的話"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0572",
        "start_sec": 1742.01,
        "end_sec": 1744.81,
        "text": "哎你模型你都不用自己去訓練哦"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0573",
        "start_sec": 1745.21,
        "end_sec": 1746.57,
        "text": "哦你都不用自己去訓練"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0574",
        "start_sec": 1746.57,
        "end_sec": 1748.37,
        "text": "你直接拿來用就好了"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0575",
        "start_sec": 1748.67,
        "end_sec": 1749.91,
        "text": "那這個大概是"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0576",
        "start_sec": 1750.41,
        "end_sec": 1753.31,
        "text": "呃open cv 跟 yolo 的差異啊"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0577",
        "start_sec": 1753.47,
        "end_sec": 1754.41,
        "text": "你就會發現哎"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0578",
        "start_sec": 1754.41,
        "end_sec": 1757.57,
        "text": "其實這些工具啊各有各自的用途啊"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0579",
        "start_sec": 1757.57,
        "end_sec": 1758.81,
        "text": "你不見得要"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0580",
        "start_sec": 1759.17,
        "end_sec": 1761.11,
        "text": "那個殺雞用牛刀哦"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0581",
        "start_sec": 1761.21,
        "end_sec": 1764.11,
        "text": "比方說如果你今天就是只要找出一個"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0582",
        "start_sec": 1764.41,
        "end_sec": 1765.11,
        "text": "一個"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0583",
        "start_sec": 1765.47,
        "end_sec": 1768.01,
        "text": "一個模型他認得出什麼是狗"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0584",
        "start_sec": 1768.31,
        "end_sec": 1769.91,
        "text": "因為對你來講"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0585",
        "start_sec": 1769.91,
        "end_sec": 1773.51,
        "text": "你可能要做的是那個流浪狗的防治"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0586",
        "start_sec": 1773.71,
        "end_sec": 1777.01,
        "text": "就是我可能要那個預防說"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0587",
        "start_sec": 1777.01,
        "end_sec": 1780.15,
        "text": "呃流浪狗在我家門口"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0588",
        "start_sec": 1780.51,
        "end_sec": 1781.21,
        "text": "出沒"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0589",
        "start_sec": 1781.41,
        "end_sec": 1784.77,
        "text": "好那我只要知道什麼時候他會出現就好了"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0590",
        "start_sec": 1784.87,
        "end_sec": 1787.31,
        "text": "我不我不需要會找車子"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0591",
        "start_sec": 1787.31,
        "end_sec": 1788.95,
        "text": "我也不需要會找人"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0592",
        "start_sec": 1789.01,
        "end_sec": 1790.31,
        "text": "我也不需要會找貓"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0593",
        "start_sec": 1790.37,
        "end_sec": 1792.17,
        "text": "我只要認得出狗就好了"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0594",
        "start_sec": 1792.27,
        "end_sec": 1793.13,
        "text": "那這時候呢"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0595",
        "start_sec": 1793.13,
        "end_sec": 1794.63,
        "text": "那你就不用 yolo 了嘛"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0596",
        "start_sec": 1794.73,
        "end_sec": 1798.03,
        "text": "哦用用那個殺雞不用用牛刀啦"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0597",
        "start_sec": 1798.67,
        "end_sec": 1799.93,
        "text": "所以大概是這樣"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0598",
        "start_sec": 1801.9,
        "end_sec": 1803.44,
        "text": "好那另外呢"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0599",
        "start_sec": 1803.44,
        "end_sec": 1805.34,
        "text": "其實open cv 哦"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0600",
        "start_sec": 1805.34,
        "end_sec": 1806.8,
        "text": "在很多那個"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0601",
        "start_sec": 1807.14,
        "end_sec": 1810.54,
        "text": "呃比較熟悉影像處理的人的"
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "video_001_seg_0602",
        "start_sec": 1811.0,
        "end_sec": 1812.44,
        "text": "那個呃"
      }
    ]
  }
